========== WHICH JOIN MESSAGE ==========
  ok   Exact mode, Overworld only -> short
  ok   ordinary Fast result (60-block gap) -> short
  ok   an explanation note (?) -> short
  ok   the stronghold explanation -> short
  ok   a find in the Nether -> LONG
  ok   a 380-block spawn-vs-origin gap -> LONG
  ok   something dropped -> LONG
  ok   no structured finds (slime / exclusion search) -> short
  ok   explanation, then something dropped -> LONG
  ok   something dropped, then an explanation -> LONG
  ok   two explanations -> short
  ok   first slime search: the note is shown
  ok   second slime search: it is not
  ok   nor in the wish parser's spelling
  ok   and only the slime part of a combined note is dropped
  ok   a note with no slime part is untouched
  ok   hint names the map key
  ok   the map that key opens (your own world) shows coordinates with the setting OFF
  ok   the search-result map does NOT with the setting off, so the hint must not send people there
  ok   hint names where the setting is for next time
  ok   hint has no digits, so the spoiler filter cannot mangle it
