==== watchdogDiag ====
========== THE SEARCH WATCHDOG ==========
  ok   a healthy search reports nothing
  ok   one seed held 61 s is reported
  ok     with the seed
  ok     with the thread's state
  ok     and a stack that reaches the stuck code
  ok     and the seed stream that replays the search
  ok   not repeated a minute later
  ok   repeated after five minutes if still stuck
  ok   no report while it is still within the minute
  ok   no seed finished for 61 s is reported with every worker
  ok   19x the estimate is not reported yet
  ok   20x the estimate with nothing found is reported
  ok     and the search screen gets its line
  ok     once only
  ok   a ROUGH estimate gets more room (30x not reported)
  ok   a search that found something is not "past its estimate"
  ok   N=3, none found: 19x one match is not reported
  ok   N=3, none found: past 20x one match is reported, as for one world
  ok   a world found clears the screen's line
  ok   N=3, one found: 39x is within the allowance for the second world
  ok   N=3, one found: past 2 matches' worth it is reported again, for the second world
  ok     and the report says how many of how many
  ok   all N found: never "past its estimate"
  ok   a world found counts as progress for "no seed has finished"
